    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then the number of solution(s) of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is/are"
