  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Let,&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Therefore, the given equation will become&nbsp;<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>∴</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>±</mo><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math><br />Hence, the number of solutions are<br /><math><mn>4</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math><br />{<math><mo>∵</mo><mn>4</mn></math> solutions in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>}"
